# Normalise line endings across platforms.
#
# Without this, Git converts LF to CRLF on Windows checkout while .prettierrc
# specifies endOfLine: "lf" — so `npm run format:check` fails on a fresh clone
# even though nothing is wrong with the code. Forcing LF in the working tree
# keeps the quality gates passing on any machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip  binary

# Generated — collapse in diffs and exclude from language statistics.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
